@title Hoist in 3D: the crane picture opens from Ctrl+K and shows the hook of the hoist at rest
@area Simulate
# Opens the two-speed hoist fixture and the Hoist in 3D window without a run: the hook stands at its start.
open qa/fixtures/hoist-two-speed.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Hoist in 3D
wait 4
key Enter
wait 30
shot hook-at-start
expect "Hoist in 3D"
expect "Picture, not measurement"
expect "No run: the hook stands at its start"
check_layout
